    "the group and index numbers are the PS1 SYSTEM dump's, because Langrisser V",
    "was translated on PS1 first and the language pack is keyed by them.",
    "An entry maps to one of those ids, to a language-specific override",
    "under the pack's releases/<slug>/, or preserves its original token",
    "stream when it is non-text or patched by a separate Saturn adapter."
